From 3d4fcbe33c64fc476a45e4ef581f8de874a43d7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiniGo <dev@minigo.app>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:05:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add MiniGo wallet module

MiniGo injects a SEP-43 provider as window.mini (in its mobile in-app
browser and its browser extension) with a window.stellar sentinel
{ provider: "minigo" }. The module talks to it directly, waits briefly
for the minigo#initialized event, unwraps SEP-43 { error } results into
rejections, and reports itself as the platform wrapper inside the app.

No extra dependencies or polyfills. Included in defaultModules() and
sep43Modules().
